{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:u000002", "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Developers launch when the prices are booming, but the tower takes three or four years. So everything launched in A4 year of 2013 delivered in a cool down market of two thousand sixteen, seventeen, eighteen.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:u000003"}], "text": "Developers launch projects when prices are booming, resulting in a late supply that arrives during market cool down phases."}, "title": "Understanding Market Crashes", "topic": "Economic Patterns"}, "content_hash": "393f9113551e148236e506439d9465eefd0d604a847b18b98e838a55d10287e8", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:knowledge:bd763fc7ef4bf288", "metadata_hash": "8522804545efe130cc77855ae1a8572768fc1885ee368599ed1df900bbd21af5", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-29T13:20:06Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "27cb8b82b2833e32bf7739cd09ab1b0a0a5598a6bf98580395be072a31ae2ff8", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd32mZqhzOY/", "title": "Understanding Market Crashes", "topic": "Economic Patterns", "topic_slug": "economic-patterns"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:u000002", "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:u000003"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Phase one, recovery. From late twenty eleven, the confidence crept back. Prices ticked up.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:u000002"}, {"quote": "Phase two, expansion. Dubai won Expo in November twenty thirteen, and the market cut fire, sixty one percent growth under two years.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:u000002"}], "text": "The explanation of market phases is structured into distinct stages: recovery, expansion, and hyper supply."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Explaining Market Phases", "topic": "Economic Patterns"}, "content_hash": "393f9113551e148236e506439d9465eefd0d604a847b18b98e838a55d10287e8", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:expression:ffbe6a5b143cd32e", "metadata_hash": "8522804545efe130cc77855ae1a8572768fc1885ee368599ed1df900bbd21af5", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-29T13:20:06Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "27cb8b82b2833e32bf7739cd09ab1b0a0a5598a6bf98580395be072a31ae2ff8", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd32mZqhzOY/", "title": "Explaining Market Phases", "topic": "Economic Patterns", "topic_slug": "economic-patterns"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:u000003"], "form": "wording", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Supply always arrives late to the party.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:u000003"}], "text": "Uses the metaphor 'supply always arrives late to the party' to describe the timing of market supply relative to demand."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Hyper Supply Explanation", "topic": "Economic Patterns"}, "content_hash": "393f9113551e148236e506439d9465eefd0d604a847b18b98e838a55d10287e8", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5:expression:c325476e9d76d930", "metadata_hash": "8522804545efe130cc77855ae1a8572768fc1885ee368599ed1df900bbd21af5", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-29T13:20:06Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "27cb8b82b2833e32bf7739cd09ab1b0a0a5598a6bf98580395be072a31ae2ff8", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-29-how-to-explain-to-the-md-9ac1b0e2b5", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd32mZqhzOY/", "title": "Hyper Supply Explanation", "topic": "Economic Patterns", "topic_slug": "economic-patterns"}
